WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.000
welcome to this short lesson on modes

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
object mode is where you work on whole objects

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
to change the shape of a mesh you need to enter edit mode

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
so click the cube first

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000
now select a vertex and drag it a little

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000
now select a vertex and drag it a little

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.000


00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
when you are done toggle back into object mode

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.000
if you made a mistake simply hit control z to undo

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
fun fact lights and cameras have no edit mode

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.000
to edit two cubes at once select both cubes and go into edit mode

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.000
you cannot connect vertices between two objects

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:24.000
so go to the object menu and select join

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.000
to split them apart again go into edit mode select part

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.000
of the mesh then use the mesh menu and select separate
